    "body": "Issue sweep: this looks no longer applicable: `OpParams::Pocket3D` and `OpParams::MultiAxisRough` carry no `tilt` field on `upstream/main` (`b13f790ec`). `OpParams::tilt` returns `None` for both kinds. `OpFrame::of` reads only `op.params.tilt()`. `CreateOperation` and `EditOperationParams` cannot receive a tilted whole-model 3D Pocket. No test in `crates/app/tests/` can build that input. The test `pocket3d_open_side::no_3d_pocket_kind_carries_a_tilt` pins this premise. `open_footprint` keeps `TILTED_OPEN_SIDE` as a guard. The maintainer decides whether to close it.",
